function renderTrade(ut){const {T,teams,t,ev}=tradeCtx(ut);const f=ui.trF||'make';const st=SL.standings(SL.compOf(ut));const rk=x=>st.findIndex(y=>y.id===x.id)+1;
  let h=`<div class="mkh"><span class="t">트레이드 제안</span></div><div class="mktabs4">${[['make','트레이드 제안'],['in','수신 제안'],['hist','트레이드 이력']].map(x=>`<button class="${f===x[0]?'on':''}" onclick="UI.set('trF','${x[0]}')">${x[1]}</button>`).join('')}</div>`;
  if(f==='in'){h+=`<div class="mkcard">${mkSec('받은 제안')}${S.market.offers.map(offerCard).join('')||'<div class="muted small">받은 제안이 없습니다.</div>'}</div>`;return h;}
  if(f==='hist'){const rows=Object.values(S.players).flatMap(p=>(p.transfers||[]).filter(x=>x.kind==='트레이드'&&(x.from===ut.name||x.to===ut.name)).map(x=>({p,x}))).sort((a,b)=>b.x.s-a.x.s).slice(0,20);h+=`<div class="mkcard" style="padding:0"><table class="mkt"><thead><tr><th>시즌</th><th class="tn">선수</th><th>이동</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(r=>`<tr onclick="UI.openPlayer(${r.p.id})"><td>${mkYear(r.x.s)}</td><td class="tn">${esc(r.p.name)}</td><td class="tc small">${esc(r.x.from)} → ${esc(r.x.to)}</td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="3" class="muted">없음</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div>`;return h;}
  const card=(p,side)=>{const o=SL.calcOvr(p);return `<div class="tcard"><div class="row" style="gap:8px">${face(p,56)}<div><b style="font-size:17px">${esc(p.name)}</b><div class="small"><span class="ptg">${p.pos}</span> ${p.age}세 <span class="gl ${SL.gradeOf(o)}">${SL.gradeOf(o)}</span> ${Math.round(o)}</div></div><button class="sm ghost" style="margin-left:auto" onclick="UI.tradeToggle('${side}',${p.id})">✕</button></div><table class="kvt"><tr><td>나이</td><td>${p.age}세</td></tr><tr><td>연봉</td><td>${p.contract?Ms(p.contract.salary):'-'}</td></tr><tr><td>역할</td><td>${esc(side==='give'?role(p):(t.lineup.includes(p.id)?'주전 '+t.pos[p.id]:t.rotation.includes(p.id)?'선발':t.closer===p.id?'마무리':t.bullpen.includes(p.id)?'중간계투':'백업'))}</td></tr></table></div>`;};
  const G=T.give.map(id=>S.players[id]).filter(Boolean),R=T.get.map(id=>S.players[id]).filter(Boolean);const sal=a=>a.reduce((s,p)=>s+(p.contract?p.contract.salary:0),0);
  h+=`<div class="mkcard"><div class="row" style="gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between"><div class="row" style="gap:8px">${emblem(ut,40)}<div><b>${esc(ut.name)}</b><div class="small muted">KBO | ${rk(ut)}위 (${ut.rec.w}승 ${ut.rec.l}패)</div></div></div><span style="font-size:20px">⇄</span><div class="row" style="gap:8px">${emblem(t,40)}<div><select class="sm" style="font-weight:800" onchange="UI.tradeSet('tid',+this.value)">${teams.map(x=>`<option value="${x.id}" ${x.id===t.id?'selected':''}>${esc(x.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select><div class="small muted">KBO | ${rk(t)}위 (${t.rec.w}승 ${t.rec.l}패) · ${esc(SL.AIM_KO[SL.aimOf(t)]||'')}</div></div></div></div></div>`;
  h+=`<div class="sg2"><div><div class="thd">내보내는 선수 (${esc(ut.name)})</div>${G.map(p=>card(p,'give')).join('')}<button class="ghost" style="width:100%" onclick="UI.tradePick('give')">+ 선수 추가 (${G.length}/3)</button><div class="kvbox"><span>드래프트 지명권</span><b>-</b></div></div><div><div class="thd alt">받아오는 선수 (${esc(t.name)})</div>${R.map(p=>card(p,'get')).join('')}<button class="ghost" style="width:100%" onclick="UI.tradePick('get')">+ 선수 추가 (${R.length}/3)</button><div class="kvbox"><span>+ 현금 조정</span><select class="sm" onchange="UI.tradeSet('cash',+this.value)">${[0,5000,10000,20000,50000,100000].map(v=>`<option value="${v}" ${T.cash===v?'selected':''}>${v?Ms(v):'없음'}</option>`).join('')}</select></div></div></div>`;
  h+=`<div class="mkcard" style="padding:0">${mkSec('트레이드 요약')}<table class="mkt sum"><thead><tr><th class="tn">구분</th><th>${esc(ut.name)} (내보냄)</th><th class="alt">${esc(t.name)} (받아옴)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="tn">선수 수</td><td class="tc">${G.length}명</td><td class="tc">${R.length}명</td></tr><tr><td class="tn">연봉 합계</td><td class="tc">${Ms(sal(G))}</td><td class="tc">${Ms(sal(R))}</td></tr><tr><td class="tn">현금 조정</td><td class="tc">${T.cash?'-'+Ms(T.cash):'-'}</td><td class="tc">${T.cash?'+'+Ms(T.cash):'-'}</td></tr><tr><td class="tn">순 연봉 변동</td><td class="tc"></td><td class="tc ${sal(R)-sal(G)<=0?'ok':'bad'}"><b>${sal(R)-sal(G)>0?'+':''}${Ms(sal(R)-sal(G))} (${sal(R)-sal(G)<=0?'절감':'증가'})</b></td></tr>${ev?`<tr><td class="tn">성사 가능성</td><td class="tc" colspan="2"><b class="${ev.chance>=80?'ok':'bad'}">${ev.chance}%</b></td></tr>`:''}</tbody></table></div>`;
  const opin=(()=>{if(!G.length&&!R.length)return '양쪽 선수를 골라 주세요.';const u=p=>SL.unitOf(p);const plus=[...new Set(R.map(u))].map(k=>SL.UNIT_KO[k]+' 보강'),minus=[...new Set(G.map(u))].map(k=>SL.UNIT_KO[k]+' 약화');return (plus.length?`<span class="ok">${plus.join(' · ')}</span>`:'')+(plus.length&&minus.length?' · ':'')+(minus.length?`<span class="o">${minus.join(' · ')}</span>`:'')+(ev&&ev.why&&ev.why.length?`<div class="small muted" style="margin-top:4px">${ev.why.map(esc).join(' · ')}</div>`:'');})();
  h+=`<div class="mkcard"><div class="row" style="gap:12px;align-items:center"><span class="coach">👔<small>수석코치</small></span><div><div class="small muted">코칭스태프 의견</div><div style="font-size:17px;font-weight:800">${opin}</div></div></div></div>`;
  h+=mkBtn2(`<button class="ghost big" onclick="UI.tradePick('${G.length>=3?'get':'give'}')">👤+ 선수 추가</button>`,`<button class="primary big" ${ev&&SL.tradeOpen()?'':'disabled'} onclick="UI.tradeGo()">✈ 제안 보내기</button>`);return h;}
function renderMarket(){const ut=SL.userTeam();const sub=ui.sub.market;const h=hubTabs('market');if(sub==='fa')return h+renderFaMock(ut);if(sub==='fgn')return h+renderFgnMock(ut);if(sub==='draft')return h+renderDraftMock(ut);if(sub==='trade')return h+renderTrade(ut);return renderMarket0();}
